# oracle: atom_style ellipsoid pair gayberne: ellipsoid-ellipsoid pairs with four types, different shapes, epsilon a,b,c and orientations, gamma/upsilon/mu not 1, mixed I J pairs (1 3, 2 3, 1 4 etc. unset), per-pair cutoff, and several run 0 blocks with set quat, shape and displace_atoms between them; torque checksums and pressure in thermo
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units           lj
atom_style      ellipsoid
boundary        f f f
region          box block 0 16 0 16 0 16
create_box      4 box
